# Built JS/CSS bundles — produced by `npm run build:all`.
# All three framework bundles (runtime JS, design-system CSS, Syncfusion CSS)
# build into Alis.Reactive.Assets/dist/. They are served to the sandbox via a
# CompositeFileProvider in SandboxApp/Program.cs and packed into their
# respective NuGets — never copied into sandbox wwwroot. Sandbox-only bundles
# live in SandboxApp/wwwroot/.
Alis.Reactive.Assets/dist/
Alis.Reactive.SandboxApp/wwwroot/js/sandbox-plugins.js
Alis.Reactive.SandboxApp/wwwroot/js/sandbox-components.js
Alis.Reactive.SandboxApp/wwwroot/js/sandbox-components.css
Alis.Reactive.SandboxApp/wwwroot/css/sandbox.css

# AlisReactive NuGet copies versioned bundles into consumer wwwroot after every
# build (see Alis.Reactive/build/AlisReactive.targets CopyAlisReactiveAssets).
# Source of truth is the NuGet package; tracked copies only produce phantom
# diffs and orphaned files when the AlisReactive version bumps.
examples/resident-intake/wwwroot/scripts/alis-reactive.*.js
examples/resident-intake/wwwroot/css/design-system.*.css
examples/resident-intake/wwwroot/css/syncfusion.*.css
# The framework test app's components bundle, built by npm run build:all.
tests/Alis.Reactive.Framework.App/wwwroot/js/
